# The walkthroughs' dodgems moves were written for some other board:
# under this seed every one of them bounced off "You're not allowed
# to move a piece onto another piece" -- five silent refusals in a
# dialect the guard does not know yet, which is why the puzzle sat
# "still working" in every ending. This line instead came from a
# sixty-run search of Catharine's actual game tree: seven moves to
# walk both cars off the top while her dodgems are still queuing.
# "A splendid performance," she says. The stray opening move stays
# deliberately: she deals out the board and explains the rules
# during that turn, and every scheduled event downstream counts on
# the turn budget staying exactly as recorded.

